nsbi-lhc-toolkit / nsbi-common-utils
------------------------------------

The native density-ratio training and diagnostics, workspace conventions, and
JAX/iminuit inference design include code and implementation patterns adapted
from:

  nsbi-lhc-toolkit
  https://github.com/iris-hep/nsbi-lhc-toolkit
  MIT License
  Copyright (c) 2025-present jsandesa
  <jay.ajitbhai.sandesara@cern.ch>

hnsbi-toolkit does not install, import, clone, or vendor nsbi-lhc-toolkit at
runtime. The adapted implementation is maintained inside hnsbi-toolkit. The
upstream MIT license is available at:
https://github.com/iris-hep/nsbi-lhc-toolkit/blob/main/LICENSE.txt

pyhf
----

The HistFactory projection example and hnsbi.pyhf_tools interfaces use pyhf's
public fitting, hypothesis-testing, and upper-limit APIs:

  pyhf
  https://github.com/scikit-hep/pyhf
  Apache License 2.0
  Copyright 2018 pyhf Developers

pyhf is an optional runtime dependency of the `lhc` extra; its source is not
vendored here. Its license is available at:
https://github.com/scikit-hep/pyhf/blob/main/LICENSE

