DINGO examples
--------------

The reduced BBH and BNS examples are scientifically inspired by the DINGO and
DINGO-BNS literature and public tutorials. They copy no DINGO source code,
pretrained model, waveform, PSD, detector data, or other asset. Their detailed
scope and citations are recorded in docs/examples/dingo.md.

